+> ⛔⛔⛔ **WHAT THIS DOCUMENT IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT.** This is **EXTERNAL RESEARCH** into the Protestant commentary tradition on one verse, on the model of `Ritualist_Case_For_Incense_and_the_1899_Opinion.md` (`260835-33`/`34`) and `Calvin_Luther_and_Anglican_Formularies_on_Iconography.md`. ⛔ **NOTHING HERE IS A FINDING ABOUT REV. JAMES.** ⛔ **He is not quoted, characterised, or attributed anywhere in this file. No claim in this document may be cited as evidence of anything he holds, has said, or would say.** ⛔ **This file does NOT enter `SRC_Coverage_Register.md`** — that register's subject is coverage of Rev. James's own material (§12 ruling). It is registered instead in `SRC_Manifest.md`'s unnumbered **External Primary Texts** section, alongside the Westall material and the two prayer books, per the `260835-35` class-wide ruling.
